{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/hen_house_2.gif?t=1752574062\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/BreadChickens_eng.png?t=1752574062\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with basic chickens and breed them to discover new appearances, mutations, and hidden DNA traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/breeds.gif?t=1752574062\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/HatchAndRaise_eng.png?t=1752574062\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lay eggs, hatch chicks, and influence their traits using feed and potions. Guide their growth to shape your dream chicken.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/transparent_runGIF.gif?t=1752574062\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/CraftMagicalPotions_eng.png?t=1752574062\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the alchemy table to create potions that manipulate traits and enhance your breeding strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/slot_traits.gif?t=1752574062\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageba